{"text": "It is an appointment that we made twenty years ago, the man went on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It sounds a little funny to you, I am sure, so I will explain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There used to be a restaurant where this store stands, Big Joe Bradys restaurant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was here until five years ago, said the policeman, Then it was torn down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The man in the doorway struck a match and lit his cigar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The light showed a pale face with a square jaw and sharp eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was also a little white scar near his right eyebrow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His scarfpin was a large diamond, which was set in a strange way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twenty years ago tonight, I ate dinner here with Jimmy Wells, who was my best friend. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We grew up here in New York like two brothers, I was eighteen, and Jimmy was twenty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning I was leaving for the West, but Jimmy would never leave New York. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We agreed to meet here again in exactly twenty years, no matter what happened.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", "n", " ", "a", "p", "p", "o", "i", "n", "t", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "w", "e", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "t", "w", "e", "n", "t", "y", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "a", "g", "o", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "s", "o", "u", "n", "d", "s", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "f", "u", "n", "n", "y", " ", "t", "o", " ", "y", "o", "u", ",", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "s", "u", "r", "e", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "e", "x", "p", "l", "a", "i", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e",